\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The moment comes from two points}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{For distinct points the expectation in the
[dyadic increment](fdip-00E5) equals the two-point formula
of \ref{fdip-00BD}. That formula is read from a
[cyclic arc precision](fdip-00B6) on a two-point set.
\ref{fdip-00BG} identifies the same number with a Green
function on the circle.}
